  "2026-08-06T18:02:58.516Z","harness:codex","Implementation: advanced @toon-format/toon from 4.1.0 to the latest compatible 4.1.1 patch. The package remains within the existing semver and supported-runtime policy; package and lockfile are linked for traceability."
  "2026-08-06T20:12:28.329Z","harness:codex","Final verification: exact coverage passed across 441 files and 6,902 tests at 100% statements (49461/49461), branches (35933/35933), functions (10115/10115), and lines (47921/47921). TypeScript, ESLint, duplicate detection, 100% docstrings, contracts, SDK surface, package boundaries, SDK parity, token/context/tracker gates, zero-vulnerability audits, and temporary packed npx/direct-SDK/bunx acceptance passed. Timing budgets passed in a clean isolated sample; later host-load samples were invalidated by unrelated system contention without changing budgets."
